{"id": "D001", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "The mileage rate is 25p per mile after the first 10,000 business miles in a tax year.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["HR-201:v4.0:s4:c1"], "cited_text": {"HR-201:v4.0:s4:c1": "Staff who use their own car for business journeys can claim 45p per mile for the first 10,000 business miles in a tax year and 25p per mile after that. Your normal commute between home and your usual workplace cannot be claimed. Record the start and end point and the purpose of each journey."}, "cited_by_model": ["HR-201:v4.0:s4:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s4:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.602547287940979, "sections": ["HR-201#4"]}, {"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s1:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.3851396143436432, "sections": ["HR-202#1"]}, {"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s5:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.3277320861816406, "sections": ["HR-201#5"]}, {"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s4:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.31450581550598145, "sections": ["HR-202#4"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s5:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.2801908850669861, "sections": ["HR-203#5"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 907, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 60, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 17, "cost_usd": 0.00012104, "retrieval_ms": 265.4767999993055, "generation_ms": 1680.1921000005677, "total_ms": 1945.6688999998732, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_ed5d8fc034c643da8688ceb3cdc3af39", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D002", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "A new supplier must provide proof of public liability insurance of at least £5 million. If it employs staff, it must also provide employer’s liability insurance; the handbook does not specify a cover amount for that insurance.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["SUP-501:v1.0:s2:c1"], "cited_text": {"SUP-501:v1.0:s2:c1": "New suppliers must provide proof of public liability insurance of at least £5 million and, where they employ staff, employer's liability insurance. Suppliers that will process personal data on Fernhollow's behalf must also complete the data protection questionnaire, which Information Security reviews."}, "cited_by_model": ["SUP-501:v1.0:s2:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.5376452803611755, "sections": ["SUP-501#2"]}, {"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s1:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.44892722368240356, "sections": ["SUP-501#1"]}, {"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s3:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.36791539192199707, "sections": ["SUP-501#3"]}, {"id": "FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.33940401673316956, "sections": ["FAC-401#2"]}, {"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s5:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.3364364504814148, "sections": ["SUP-501#5"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 876, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 205, "reasoning_tokens": 123, "embedding_tokens": 14, "cost_usd": 0.00019038, "retrieval_ms": 173.77069999929518, "generation_ms": 2872.8844000006575, "total_ms": 3046.6550999999527, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_a9d1df61f45b4b558f9dfa36a47d9f95", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D003", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "At Calder Wharf depot, the fire assembly point is the grass area beside the visitor car park.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["FAC-402:v1.5:s3:c1"], "cited_text": {"FAC-402:v1.5:s3:c1": "Go to the assembly point shown on the site plan by each exit. At Ashby Park depot this is the staff car park by the main gate. At Calder Wharf depot it is the grass area beside the visitor car park."}, "cited_by_model": ["FAC-402:v1.5:s3:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "FAC-402:v1.5:s3:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.7023938894271851, "sections": ["FAC-402#3"]}, {"id": "FAC-402:v1.5:s4:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.4171665906906128, "sections": ["FAC-402#4"]}, {"id": "FAC-402:v1.5:s5:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.3973711133003235, "sections": ["FAC-402#5"]}, {"id": "FAC-402:v1.5:s2:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.36377596855163574, "sections": ["FAC-402#2"]}, {"id": "SUP-502:v1.0:s3:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.35609909892082214, "sections": ["SUP-502#3"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 900, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 56, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 12, "cost_usd": 0.00011823999999999999, "retrieval_ms": 173.66839999976946, "generation_ms": 1133.409400000346, "total_ms": 1307.0778000001155, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_e4fa4e268bcb437cb153c5e19a81f13f", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D004", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "You should receive the access within 2 working days of the final approval.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1"], "cited_text": {"OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1": "Request access through the service portal using the \"System access\" form. Requests are fulfilled within 2 working days of the final approval. Do not share your login with a colleague who is waiting for access."}, "cited_by_model": ["OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.5332714915275574, "sections": ["OPS-104#2"]}, {"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s6:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.4666019678115845, "sections": ["OPS-104#6"]}, {"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s3:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.44069063663482666, "sections": ["OPS-104#3"]}, {"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s3:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.4014623761177063, "sections": ["SUP-501#3"]}, {"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s4:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.39404723048210144, "sections": ["OPS-104#4"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 914, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 52, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 19, "cost_usd": 0.00011778000000000001, "retrieval_ms": 178.77820000012434, "generation_ms": 1535.6363999999303, "total_ms": 1714.4146000000546, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_bfb09ccee29340729627ae3a5896443c", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D005", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "Vehicle telematics data is kept for 2 years.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["SEC-302:v3.1:s2:c1"], "cited_text": {"SEC-302:v3.1:s2:c1": "| Record | Retention period |\n|---|---|\n| Delivery and proof-of-delivery records | 6 years from the delivery date |\n| Vehicle telematics data | 2 years |\n| CCTV footage from depots | 31 days, unless needed for an investigation |\n| IT incident and change tickets | 3 years from closure |\n| System access logs | 12 months |"}, "cited_by_model": ["SEC-302:v3.1:s2:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.608076274394989, "sections": ["SEC-302#2"]}, {"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s3:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.4726789593696594, "sections": ["SEC-302#3"]}, {"id": "FAC-401:v2.0:s5:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.4355066120624542, "sections": ["FAC-401#5"]}, {"id": "SUP-502:v1.0:s3:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.39946693181991577, "sections": ["SUP-502#3"]}, {"id": "OPS-105:v1.1:s5:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.389585018157959, "sections": ["OPS-105#5"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 952, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 82, "reasoning_tokens": 32, "embedding_tokens": 13, "cost_usd": 0.00013645999999999998, "retrieval_ms": 351.9856000002619, "generation_ms": 2106.241399999817, "total_ms": 2458.227000000079, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_ccd1997894e845918389f7e1dfa16ff3", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D006", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "Full-time staff receive 25 days of annual leave plus bank holidays each leave year, which runs from 1 April to 31 March.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["HR-204:v1.0:s1:c1"], "cited_text": {"HR-204:v1.0:s1:c1": "The leave year runs from 1 April to 31 March. Full-time staff receive 25 days of annual leave plus bank holidays. Part-time staff receive a pro-rata allowance."}, "cited_by_model": ["HR-204:v1.0:s1:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "HR-204:v1.0:s1:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.42180898785591125, "sections": ["HR-204#1"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s5:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.3256976008415222, "sections": ["HR-203#5"]}, {"id": "HR-204:v1.0:s2:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.30036288499832153, "sections": ["HR-204#2"]}, {"id": "HR-204:v1.0:s3:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.299301415681839, "sections": ["HR-204#3"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s6:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.2840407192707062, "sections": ["HR-203#6"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 915, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 65, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 12, "cost_usd": 0.00012424000000000002, "retrieval_ms": 152.87050000006275, "generation_ms": 1360.806099999536, "total_ms": 1513.6765999995987, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_3cbca41b968b4de99ba3a300cdef6280", "warnings": []}
